// example/multiexploder's func_multi_exploder triggered from here: four seconds of blasts
// posted as delayed events, read during and after them.
// compare-player.ps1 -Map example/multiexploder -Probe probe-xexpl; save-load.ps1 -Map example/multiexploder -Probe probe-xexpl -Thread save

